# Individual Item Tracking API Tests
# Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar HTTP client

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001/api/v1
@authToken = your-jwt-token-here
@productId = your-product-id-here
@shopId = your-shop-id-here
@customerId = your-customer-id-here
@purchaseId = your-purchase-id-here

### 1. Get individual items for a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-items/product/{{productId}}/items?page=1&limit=10&status=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get individual items with filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-items/product/{{productId}}/items?shopId={{shopId}}&status=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get specific item details with history
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-items/item-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Move item between locations (Manager/Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product-items/item-uuid-here/move
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toShopId": "{{shopId}}",
  "reason": "Transfer to main store for display"
}

### 5. Update item status (Manager/Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product-items/item-uuid-here/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DAMAGED",
  "condition": "POOR",
  "reason": "Customer return - scratched surface"
}

### 6. Enhanced purchase receiving with individual item creation (Manager/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-items/purchase/{{purchaseId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "purchaseItemId": "purchase-item-uuid-here",
      "receivedQty": 5,
      "serialNumbers": ["SN001", "SN002", "SN003", "SN004", "SN005"]
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Enhanced sales processing with individual item tracking
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-items/sales/process
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleData": {
    "shopId": "{{shopId}}",
    "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
    "paymentMode": "CASH",
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": "{{productId}}",
        "quantity": 2,
        "unitPrice": 1299.99
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 8. Enhanced sales with specific item selection
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-items/sales/process
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleData": {
    "shopId": "{{shopId}}",
    "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
    "paymentMode": "CARD",
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": "{{productId}}",
        "quantity": 2,
        "unitPrice": 1299.99,
        "specificItemIds": ["item-uuid-1", "item-uuid-2"]
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 9. Test existing sales API (should still work)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "{{shopId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMode": "CASH",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1299.99
    }
  ]
}

### 10. Test existing inventory API (should still work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{shopId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}